COMMENT ON COLUMN LOGIN_PARAM.OTP_MAX_ATTEMPTS        IS 'Maximum wrong OTP verification attempts allowed per code (Default: 5)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN LOGIN_PARAM.OTP_RESEND_COOLDOWN_SEC IS 'Cooldown in seconds before Resend OTP is allowed (Default: 60)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN LOGIN_PARAM.OTP_MAX_RESENDS         IS 'Maximum OTP resends allowed per user within the resend window (Default: 3)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN LOGIN_PARAM.OTP_RESEND_WINDOW_MIN   IS 'Time window in minutes for tracking max OTP resends (Default: 10)';
